<title>SWEDEN: Statkraft buys 2.5 mln C-series shares in Sydkraft.</title>
<headline>Statkraft buys 2.5 mln C-series shares in Sydkraft.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statkraft said on Monday it bought 2.5 million C-series shares in Swedish power company Sydkraft AB.  </p>
<p>The shares correspond to 1.3 percent of capital and 0.21 percent of votes, lifting Statkraft's total Sydkraft stake to 15.93 percent of capital and 22.41 percent of votes, Statkraft Marketing Director Christian Rynning-Tonnesen told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't want to disclose who we bought the shares from,&quot; he said. &quot;This is an ordinary acquisition.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
